    "m_description": "SETUP REQUIRED: Open Notification Received and select only the source apps you trust before enabling. Do not select MacroDroid or NeedleBub, or result notifications can create a loop. Requires NeedleBub and the installed OTP Extractor capability. The macro sends app, title, and message text to NeedleBub locally, waits for its result, then copies and displays nb_code only when nb_matched is true.",
